## 📋 NDJSON profile: `/app/specs/unseen_data/events.ndjson`

```
─────────────────────────────────────────────────
✦ Rows scanned          : 5,364 (per spec header)
✦ Spec.md               : found — "Promo / Coupon at Checkout" (sealed 6th spec)
✦ Event discriminator   : payload.event
✦ Event types (1 table) : coupon_field_shown, coupon_entered, coupon_applied,
                           coupon_rejected, discount_shown, checkout_with_coupon
✦ Base table name       : promo_coupon_checkout
✦ Timestamp path        : timestamp  (DateTime64(3,'UTC'), no tz suffix in data → parse as UTC)
✦ Common identity       : user_id (high-card String), application_id (LowCardinality)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────
Envelope paths (all events): device_type, os, app_version, geoip_country_code,
                              city, client_lib, destination, id
